{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-e1c93933b3fd","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-e1c93933b3fd","name":"蔗糖糖浆","category":"condiment","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/condiment/%E8%94%97%E7%B3%96%E7%B3%96%E6%B5%86/%E8%94%97%E7%B3%96%E7%B3%96%E6%B5%86.md","blob_sha":"731da627a404397178d20f556a6d173a9141d391","details":{"introduction":"自制饮料糖浆，按 1：1 比例将白砂糖与水混合溶解，方便控制冷饮甜度，是调饮的基础配方。富含碳水化合物，能快速补充能量。做法极其简单，对新手非常友好，仅需几分钟即可完成，冷藏可保存一周。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"原料\n\n- 白砂糖\n- 水\n\n工具\n\n- 可密封容器（建议使用高硼硅试剂瓶，便宜）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"建议比例=>糖 : 水 = 1 : 1，这样方便进行糖量控制，比如想要 15 克糖，就量取 30 克的糖浆\n\n- 水 100 克\n- 白砂糖 100 克"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将称好的白砂糖的饮用水于容器混匀\n2. 容器封盖放冰箱冷藏"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"水无论冷热都可，如果比较急用，可用热水溶解后再冷却糖浆。\n\n配制好的糖浆不会轻易变质，在冷藏状态下保存一周通常是没问题的。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：白砂糖100g、饮用水120g；整份约200g。无其他糖浆配料，成品重量为家庭批次估算。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":193.5,"protein_g":0,"carbohydrate_g":50,"fat_g":0},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients","version":"d0a9e94c24278804","fdc_ids":[169655,173647]},"profile_id":"family-e1c93933b3fd-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-e1c93933b3fd","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-e1c93933b3fd","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-e1c93933b3fd-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"sugar","grams":100},{"key":"water","grams":120}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"d0a9e94c24278804","complet